                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Fortunately, it wasn\u0027t too expensive.\n\nThere was free hot tea and miso soup (trimmed salmon and tofu), and I had chawanmushi, hand rolls, grilled mackerel rice bowl, and salmon sushi. For some reason, my blood sugar skyrocketed after returning, and I couldn\u0027t handle any other Japanese food.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "還好，不是很貴\n有免費的熱茶跟味噌湯（修邊鮭魚跟豆腐）、吃茶碗蒸、手捲、烤鯖魚丼飯、鮭魚壽司，不知怎麼回來血糖飆高，吃別家日本料理都不會。",
